.text-center.py-20
  h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-3"
    | Value any stock
  p class="text-[#666] text-lg mb-10"
    | Fundamental analysis. No noise.

  = form_with url: stocks_search_path, method: :get, class: "flex gap-3 justify-center" do |f|
    = f.text_field :ticker, placeholder: "Enter ticker e.g. AAPL", autofocus: true, class: "w-72"
    = f.submit "Analyse", class: "!bg-[#00d4aa] !text-[#0a0a0a] font-semibold px-6 py-2.5 rounded-lg cursor-pointer hover:opacity-85 transition-opacity"